# Ignore the dissertation's *contents* rather than the directory itself. Git cannot
# re-include anything beneath an excluded directory, so `dissertation/` would make
# the exception below impossible. The prose, compiled PDFs and LaTeX build tree stay
# ignored; the code that BUILDS the figures is still code, and is versioned --
# without the exception a new figure script never even appears in `git status`.
dissertation/*
!dissertation/scripts/
